Subject: [PATCH 08/15] feat(14-05): convert curated FA Free 72-glyph subset to
 .icon files + SVGs (DESIGN-04, D-06, D-07, D-09)

- 72 .icon files in vector_icons/ each with Chromium copyright + provenance header
- 72 .svg files in svg/ each with CC BY 4.0 attribution comment from FA Free 6.7.2
- fa_sidebar_flip.{icon,svg}: hand-authored placeholder (Pro-only; not in FA Free 6.x)
- fa_arrow_down_to_line.{icon,svg}: substituted from arrow-down source per D-08
- All 70 standard glyphs converted via skiafy from Falkon v1 bundle FA source
